{"3731450": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Blop", "steam_appid": 3731450, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dive into a new adventure of Blop!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During a peaceful walk through the forest, blop find a monolith. After touching he was teleported in the dungeon. His goal is to find the way out, yours — is to help him.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Monolith:</strong><br>Find pieces of the monolith to restore its structure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731450/extras/150410073e0d4214368a89cc0f08eea1.poster.avif?t=1779829305\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731450/extras/150410073e0d4214368a89cc0f08eea1.webm?t=1779829305\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731450/extras/150410073e0d4214368a89cc0f08eea1.mp4?t=1779829305\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fruits:</strong><br>7 unique fruits with varying ripeness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731450/extras/1b527cd830d943f2629ecd4e3251a87a.avif?t=1779829305\" width=1560 height=636 /></span></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731450/extras/1fcec185fb0eb90d8d51154d332538ad.poster.avif?t=1779829305\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/